    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
        beta |        500    .2867258    .1163872  -.0218958   .6266922

. summarize se

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
          se |        500     .122857    .0058646   .1053087    .139599

. gen t_stat = beta / se

. gen rejected = (abs(t_stat) > invnormal(0.975))

. summarize rejected

    Variable |        Obs        Mean    Std. dev.       Min        Max
-------------+---------------------------------------------------------
    rejected |        500        .666     .472112          0          1

. local power_at_03 = r(mean)

. display as result "  Power at ATT=0.3 SD (N=200, T=10, rho=0.5) = " %5.3f `po
> wer_at_03'
  Power at ATT=0.3 SD (N=200, T=10, rho=0.5) = 0.666

. 
. * 断言：ATT=0.3 SD 下 power 应在 [0.5, 0.95] 范围
. * （异质 ATT + 500 reps 下应检测出 0.3 SD 效应；过 0.95 说明 power 过高，过 0
> .5 说明 simulation 异常）
. assert inrange(`power_at_03', 0.5, 0.95)

. display as result "  ✓ Power at ATT=0.3 SD 在预期范围 [0.5, 0.95]"
  ✓ Power at ATT=0.3 SD 在预期范围 [0.5, 0.95]

